{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみでっす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、Ｚｅｐｐ大阪にて記念すべき初単独ライブをやらせていただいわけですが......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違いなく一生忘れられない日になる事でしょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観にきてくれた皆様は、どうだったでしょうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん反省しなくてはならないことがたくさんありますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの中では、少しでも多くのファンの皆様に、笑顔、歌、ダンス、エネルギーが届くように、全力でパフォーマンスをしたつもりです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わったかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどまだまだ自分出来る気がする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回来れなかったファンの皆様、次のライブは絶対に来てね？。・°°・(＞_＜)・°°・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの頑張ってる姿、生で観て欲しいからね↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷ ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなあみは、Ｚｅｅｐ大阪が終わった後、速効東京に戻って、ちはると一緒に全国キャラバンのため、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道札幌に向かいました（＾Ｏ＾☆♪！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんたくさんPRさせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてもちろんご当地グルメもたくさん食べました(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼はすみれの味噌ラーメン！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかったぁ～。見た目以上にあっつあつでビックリしたけど。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よるご飯は、新鮮な海の幸を食べました(^ ^)もう本当に本当に幸せ過ぎた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道は食べ物が美味しすぎます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして何より涼しくて快適です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの写真はというと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ある取材の時の一枚。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初ビリヤードをやらせていただいたんです(｀_´)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかなか様になってるでしょ？？どや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玉に当たったときの嬉しさ(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとにたくさん貴重な経験をさせていただいて感謝！しぇいしぇい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また是非北海道行きたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問返すよ～↷꒰ू´•௰ू• `꒱↷"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ.涼しくなったら髪のばす？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.ん～特にその予定はないよぉ(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．個性的な靴とか最近買いましたー？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.買ってないよー(^ ^)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"靴欲しいのいっぱいある..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．なでしこは金メダルとれると思う？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男子は銅メダルとれると思う？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.リアルタイムに答えられなくてごめんね ( ◞˟૩˟)◞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！私は取れると思う！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．ライブで乃木坂の曲問わず歌いたい曲とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.あみ昔の曲とか結構好きなのよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3577062/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから松田聖子さんとか山口百恵さんとか昔のアイドルの歌を歌ってみたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ｑ．あみあみはメンバーにお笑いの才能あるって言われた